// Project Ditto: Johto field moves that Gen 3 lacks.
//  - HM09 Whirlpool clears whirlpools while surfing.
//  - Headbutt shakes wild Pokemon out of headbutt trees, using Crystal's tree tables and rules.
// Scripts are in data/scripts/field_move_scripts.inc; the data comes from
// src/data/johto_field_moves.h, generated by tools/ditto/import_crystal.py.
